#
# The units of libraries of ix's (mkfiles/mklib's lib.a), in the order
# they start in: what $AR t lists, a unit's source file, made its
# name. An rc script, as the recipes (mkfiles/mkconfig's $RC runs it).
# usage: $RC mkfiles/units.rc lib.a...
for(a in $*) $AR t $a | sed 's,.*/,,; s,\.ml$,,'
